SlotSpace normalizes exported document types/detail fields and derives
fact keys, silver labels and role-swap queries from this benchmark.
It preserves the original entity IDs and official query split membership.
These transformations do not change the license of the source data.

No raw STaRK records, derived benchmark answers, third-party model weights
or dependency binaries are included in this source or wheel distribution.
Follow the project's release convention: distribute role-swap query IDs,
template identifiers, value IDs and the construction code, not re-hosted
raw benchmark files. Obtain source data directly from the publisher.

